and as fans and celebrities
stream in to see the fight,

00:21:04.569 --> 00:21:05.986
Dana is behind the scenes,

00:21:05.986 --> 00:21:08.296
making sure everything
around the entire production,

00:21:08.296 --> 00:21:11.301
is happening up to his standards.

00:21:11.301 --> 00:21:12.800
You are there like literally,

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.962
like right there against the octagon.

00:21:14.962 --> 00:21:15.795
100%.

