And I know exactly what I want.

00:21:33.987 --> 00:21:37.371
We're one of the few major
sports organizations,

00:21:37.371 --> 00:21:39.729
that produce all of our own content.

00:21:39.729 --> 00:21:41.230
So everything that you see,

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.567
whether it's on ESPN,

00:21:42.567 --> 00:21:43.575
whether it's on global in Brazil,

00:21:43.575 --> 00:21:46.083
whether it's on BT in
the UK and list goes on,

00:21:46.083 --> 00:21:48.952
that stuff is all produced by us.

00:21:48.952 --> 00:21:51.228
And it's produced in a way
that has a global mindset.

00:21:51.228 --> 00:21:53.785
So when you're in China
and you're watching UFC,

00:21:53.785 --> 00:21:58.618
that market is specific to the
way the content is created.

00:22:05.122 --> 00:22:06.654
When people ask me about
the upside for this thing,

00:22:06.654 --> 00:22:07.893
I'm always like well,

00:22:07.893 --> 00:22:09.280
how many people are there on earth,

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:10.113
7 billion?

00:22:10.113 --> 00:22:13.636
So my long-term goal was to
put on fights that are doing

00:22:13.636 --> 00:22:14.559
5 million,

00:22:14.559 --> 00:22:15.699
10 million,

00:22:15.699 --> 00:22:17.734
15 million pay-per-view buys.

00:22:17.734 --> 00:22:20.869
And this thing is truly the
first real big global sport.

00:22:20.869 --> 00:22:23.046
And we have no seasons.

00:22:23.046 --> 00:22:23.879
We go 365,

00:22:25.227 --> 00:22:27.450
52 weeks a year where we're going.

00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:29.368
We got through this COVID thing,

00:22:29.368 --> 00:22:31.431
this company from all of my employees,

00:22:31.431 --> 00:22:32.901
my executive team,

00:22:32.901 --> 00:22:35.853
and to the core unit over at Endeavor,

00:22:35.853 --> 00:22:37.917
we're like this right now.

00:22:37.917 --> 00:22:40.123
We're as tight as tight can be.

00:22:40.123 --> 00:22:41.793
We're all on the same mission.

00:22:41.793 --> 00:22:43.342
We're all on the same page.

00:22:43.342 --> 00:22:46.330
And we're very scary
group of people right now.

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:47.631
We're gonna,

00:22:47.631 --> 00:22:48.807
we're gonna crush this thing.

00:22:48.807 --> 00:22:51.148
Shy of a meteor hitting the earth,

00:22:51.148 --> 00:22:52.411
I think we can get through anything.

